# IRL.OS — COMPLETE MASTER BUILD PROMPT
## Your life. Your system. Your next move.

Act as a senior full-stack developer, product designer, UX engineer, and AI architect.

Build a complete, functional, multi-page web application called **IRL.OS**.

IRL.OS is a personal operating system for real life. It helps people turn goals into manageable actions, plan around the time they actually have, adapt when plans change, track meaningful progress, and get personalized advice about what to do next.

This should be a real product, not a static mockup, generic AI wrapper, ordinary to-do list, or habit tracker with XP added to it.

The main product idea is:

**IRL.OS connects goals, available time, tasks, actual progress, and intelligent recommendations in one simple system.**

The product must remain useful without AI. When a shared application-owned Gemini API key is configured securely, it gains an optional personal AI adviser.

The application should be visually impressive, clean, interactive, maintainable, and feasible to develop as an MVP in Google AI Studio Build mode.

